      "description": "The user is projected onto the scene of children engaging in diverse physical activities together, as implied by the text 'when the muslim kids in your class start hanging out with you'. The phrase 'your class' and 'hanging out with you' explicitly deictically refer to the viewer/user, projecting the user as the central figure in the social scenario depicted. The user is positioned as the observer or participant in the social interaction, making the scene the entity onto which the user is projected.",
